flowchart TD
    User[User goal / Host] --> State[State and plan]
    State --> Context[Repo context / skills / compaction]
    Context --> Router[Model router]
    Router --> Model[Model interface]
    Model --> Decision{Decision}
    Decision -->|tool call| Policy[Schema and permission check]
    Policy --> Registry[Tool registry]
    Registry --> Read[Read / search]
    Registry --> Patch[Exact patch / diff]
    Registry --> Test[Workspace.run_tests]
    Test --> Backend{Host-selected backend}
    Backend -->|V01-V10 only| Host[Trusted fixture host runner]
    Backend -->|V11 required| Sandbox[Bubblewrap: readonly snapshot / namespaces / limits]
    Sandbox -->|setup denied| Blocked[blocked_sandbox / no fallback]
    Registry --> Reviewer[Read-only reviewer\nseparate context]
    Read --> Observation[Observation]
    Patch --> Observation
    Test --> Observation
    Reviewer --> Observation
    Observation --> State
    Decision -->|final| Gate{Fresh verification evidence?}
    Gate -->|yes| Done[Verified result]
    Gate -->|no| Reject[Unverified / reject claim]
    State --> Checkpoint[Checkpoint and fingerprints]
    Checkpoint --> State
    Budget[Shared calls / tools / chars / time budget] -.-> Model
    Budget -.-> Registry
    Trace[JSONL trace] -.-> State
    Eval[Independent outcome evaluator] -.-> Done
